も相まって、地味な作業を延々としていられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その内にそこに自分なりの楽しみを見出したりしてしまったりして、根暗っぽい印象で受け止められたりしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目や消極的な性格とは逆に超むっつり娘で、意外な食いつきを見せることがわりと良くあったりする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3145","sourceWorkId":"19866","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分に自信がなく、変わりたいと願う一年生の後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"碧空学園長の愛娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"入学にあたって生まれ育った広島を出て上京＆入寮。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人は方言を気にして隠してるつもりだけどもダダ漏れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ウチももうちょっとしゃんとせんにゃいけんけど、どうしゃあ、ええんかねえ。 人には相談できんけえ、どうしようかいねえ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"24293"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"78 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3145","sourceWorkId":"19866","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"153 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3145","sourceWorkId":"19866","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3145","sourceWorkId":"19866","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"52 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3145","sourceWorkId":"19866","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/559462908fcdca8fda68f8dab4847cfb001f7a4240dd4c23fc63d1c0ec3e84ba.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/5224e8260fe0850076b15ea1e77bbd83f656bd3df59db9f440cf0962ae9267b9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高田初美","creatorId":"vndb:s363","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s363","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s363","name":"高田 初美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:101460:24293:5052:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c17513","characterName":"星那 マリア","sour